body: The registry reports pm-cli 2026.10.20. Keep PR 100 scoped to the requested 2026.10.19 oracle. Update the oracle in a separate branch; classify published changes and retained quirks; prove regressions by behavioural revert; require full unchanged coverage and Linux/macOS/Windows CI. Full-field local search and GitHub issue/PR searches found no existing 2026.10.20 follow-up.
